  "description": "There's a such moment in your life. All of a sudden, you happen to look the world through a pastel tone filter from a high-teen romance film, and the moment when the sunlight through leaves gets brighter. The moment when a blink of an eye clearly reflects one single person for a long time. \n\nIn other words, this is a story about recognizing our first love and a process of telling the feeling.",
